# ==============================================================================
# Aetheria 3D Global Weather - Environment Configuration Reference
# ==============================================================================
# The default weather provider (Open-Meteo), air quality provider (Open-Meteo Air Quality),
# and dynamic landmark discovery provider (Wikipedia REST & Wikimedia Commons)
# require ZERO API keys.
#
# If you wish to configure optional authenticated raster basemaps or third-party APIs:
# ==============================================================================


# (Optional) OpenWeatherMap API Key (for secondary fallback)
OPENWEATHER_API_KEY=your_openweathermap_api_key_here

# (Optional) Unsplash Access Key (for alternative high-res photography)
UNSPLASH_ACCESS_KEY=your_unsplash_access_key_here
